      ],
      "constraint_id": "source:house119-session1-roll299-immigration-attribution",
      "detail": "Limit Immigration attribution to the specific111(c)(1) personal nationality/permanent-residence applicant-criterion reversal within the whole repeal/restoration. Other policing/paraphernalia/emergency-aid provisions remain package context; no component stance, automatic officer discharge or individual eligibility result.",
