      "semantic_effect": "bounds_cross_domain_attribution",
      "detail": "Limit Immigration attribution to changed criminal detention/release for the specifically incorporated knowing document felony, including passports/immigration documents, with unlawful-authority/travel/labor-purpose qualifications. Other treatment/bond/offense provisions remain whole-package context; no component stance, immigration-status detention/removal, new offense or individual outcome."
    },
